<title>CHINA: Shanghai industry value up 13.5 pct in Q1.</title>
<headline>Shanghai industry value up 13.5 pct in Q1.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-04-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shanghai's industrial output value increased by a year-on-year 13.5 percent to 1.192 billion yuan in the first quarter of the year, the Business news said on Sunday.</p>
<p>Industrial sales turnover rose by a year-on-year 11.4 percent to 1.149 billion yuan, the newspaper said but gave no details.</p>
</text>
